The authority\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2619:  outcome projection at the identity `\"<arb>/outcomes\"`.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2647:## §7.10 Invariant compliance\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2652:| No implicit control flow | Resume happens only at a safepoint the machine's parking transitions define; the successor chain is explicit `:yin.k/origin` links; the exporting state is an observed data state, never a notification. |\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2667:## §7.11 Acceptance blockers for the implementation phase\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2727:  on the reference machine to each safepoint of the complete §7.4.1 table —\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2732:  projection/direct-path image-equality assertion.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2737:### Holder driver scheduling and retained inboxes (D15a)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2743:handoff body, authority fact, lease fact, or DaoStream outcome vocabulary.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2830:### 7.11.1 Blocker-closure acceptance matrix\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2887:  at one pc, a nonempty ready queue, a nonsafepoint pc, and a kept response\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2896:  and effect trace must agree in both directions. Static\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2897:  `:yin.safepoint/kinds`, stack effect, and lexical reads agree with the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2903:  `:yin.k/not-at-safepoint`; queued work gives `:yin.k/not-quiescent`.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2959:  the safepoint row before cross-host values are accepted. Phase 1\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3025:This block adds obligations; it changes no row above. The safepoint\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3058:   both; a composition requiring exclusive refuses it. Stage: D.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3065:   `:yin.k/undecodable` with the path. Stage: D.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3069:   Stage: D for assignment and restoration; C for durable input\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3078:   over an attempted write is `:unprotected-pending`. Stage: D for\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3079:   these structural checks. Stage: C for authoritative membership\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3096:   version-0 tests. Stage: D.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3106:   appears in any body. Stage: C for the consumer, D for the writer.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3112:   the epoch is recovered and raised, never reset. Stage: C for the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3134:   record. Stage: C for the consumer, D for the driver.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3141:   Stage: C for the epoch, D for the sequence.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3145:    completion and around result delivery. Stage: E.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
